---

## Success Criteria

- Test file(s) created or updated
- Tests cover bug scenario, edge cases, and regressions
- All tests use proper assertions (no skipped tests)
- New tests PASS ✓
- Existing tests still PASS ✓
- TEST_RESULTS.md documents all verification
- No test failures in output
